IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLASHSPEC-VERIFY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DRAFTS-COUNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACCEPTED-TOKENS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PRUNING-PCT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X10         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLASHSPEC.
    IF DRAFTS-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 65 TO PRUNING-PCT.
    MOVE ACCEPTED-TOKENS TO SPEEDUP-X10.
    MULTIPLY 7 BY SPEEDUP-X10.
    ADD 10 TO SPEEDUP-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SPEEDUP-X10.
    WEIGHT 30 PRUNING-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
